          "label": "Unit 2 - conditional maximum if nothing was ever raised",
          "value": "11.5% of skipped years (1.8 + 0.7 + 2.3 + 3.6 + 1.7 + 1.4) plus 1.6% = 13.1%; $3,150 x 13.1% = $412.65, or $3,562.65",
