            "S05",
            "S04",
            "S02"
          ],
          "notes": "Conditional arithmetic only: it assumes no increase since June 1, 2019, which the owner has not confirmed. A combined increase above 10% also requires 90 days' written notice, and the effective date must fall on or before 2/28/2027 for the 1.6% component to be the published rate.",
